    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "3-Bedroom Bungalow on 1/2 acre site\nThis attractive property will make a fine family home for anyone seeking a renovation project. The property has been vacant for over 10 years and may qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, subject to the relevant criteria and approval.\n\nLocated along a quiet rural laneway, approximately 200m off the N17 (SligoGalway Road), the property is approximately one mile north of Charlestown and south of Curry. These towns and villages offer primary and post-primary schools, numerous sporting facilities, clothing shops, grocery shops and other amenities. Ireland West Airport Knock is within a 10-minute drive.\n\nAccommodation\n\nThe house extends to approximately 100m and includes:\n\nFront Entrance 3.5m x 1m\nSitting Room 4m x 3.6m\nLiving Room 4.6m x 3.3m with open fireplace\nBedroom 1 4.2m x 2.8m\nBedroom 2 4.2m x 2.8m\nBedroom 3 / Office 4m x 2m\nRear Hallway 3.5m x 1m\nKitchen / Dining Area 4.2m x 3.5m\nHot Press / Pantry 1.8m x 1.4m\nBathroom 3.1m x 1.8m with bath, shower and WHB\n\nOther Features\n\n360 access around the property\nLawns to the front and rear, with a galvanised shed (3.6m x 2.5m) at the rear\nLarge lawn area to the side, offering potential for a vegetable garden or similar use\nConcrete yard area at the rear\nOil-fired central heating\n\nThe property is ideal for a new owner seeking to renovate and reconfigure a home to suit their own taste. Viewing is highly recommended.\n\nEmail: info@reamccarrick.ie\nTele: 071 91 85050\n\n"
      },
      {
